<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FBType Name="Q_CtrlAudioSignal" Comment="Command Control audio device ( Part 6 - F.10 ).">
	<Identification Standard="ISO 11783-6" Description="Copyright (c) 2022 HR Agrartechnik GmbH  &#10; &#10;This program and the accompanying materials are made  &#10;available under the terms of the Eclipse Public License 2.0  &#10;which is available at https://www.eclipse.org/legal/epl-2.0/  &#10; &#10;SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0  &#10;   &#10;   &#10;see Description Tab">
	</Identification>
	<VersionInfo Organization="HR Agrartechnik GmbH" Version="1.0" Author="Franz Höpfinger" Date="2022-07-08">
	</VersionInfo>
	<CompilerInfo packageName="isobus::UT::Q">
	</CompilerInfo>
	<InterfaceList>
		<EventInputs>
			<Event Name="INIT" Type="EInit" Comment="Service Initialization">
				<With Var="QI"/>
			</Event>
			<Event Name="REQ" Type="Event" Comment="Service Request">
				<With Var="QI"/>
				<With Var="u8NumOfRepit"/>
				<With Var="u16Frequency"/>
				<With Var="u16OnTimeMs"/>
				<With Var="u16OffTimeMs"/>
			</Event>
		</EventInputs>
		<EventOutputs>
			<Event Name="INITO" Type="EInit" Comment="Initialization Confirm">
				<With Var="QO"/>
			</Event>
			<Event Name="CNF" Type="Event" Comment="Confirmation of Requested Service">
				<With Var="QO"/>
				<With Var="STATUS"/>
				<With Var="u16OldOnTimeMs"/>
				<With Var="u8OldNumOfRepit"/>
				<With Var="u16OldFrequency"/>
				<With Var="s16result"/>
				<With Var="u16OldOffTimeMs"/>
			</Event>
		</EventOutputs>
		<InputVars>
			<VarDeclaration Name="QI" Type="BOOL" Comment="Quality Input - TRUE to enable service" InitialValue="TRUE"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u8NumOfRepit" Type="USINT" Comment="Number of repetitions Range: 1 - 255"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16Frequency" Type="UINT" Comment="Frequency "/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OnTimeMs" Type="UINT" Comment="On time duration in ms"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OffTimeMs" Type="UINT" Comment="Off time duration in ms"/>
		</InputVars>
		<OutputVars>
			<VarDeclaration Name="QO" Type="BOOL" Comment="Quality Output - TRUE if service executed successfully"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="STATUS" Type="STRING" Comment="Service Status"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u8OldNumOfRepit" Type="USINT" Comment="Old Number of repetitions Range: 1 - 255"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OldFrequency" Type="UINT" Comment="Old Frequency"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OldOnTimeMs" Type="UINT" Comment="Old on time duration in ms"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OldOffTimeMs" Type="UINT" Comment="Old off time duration in ms"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="s16result" Type="INT" Comment="retval see description"/>
		</OutputVars>
	</InterfaceList>
	<Attribute Name="Documentation" Type="CDATA"><![CDATA[<h1>Command Control audio device ( Part 6 - F.10 )</h1>

<p>This command can be used to control the audio on the VT.</p>

<p>The Control Audio Signal command (F.10) addresses the VT's <strong>audio device</strong> directly — it does <strong>not reference any object</strong>, so this FB has no Object ID input and no "Valid Object IDs" restriction. Data length is a fixed 8 bytes (Activations, Frequency, On-time, Off-time). <strong>Activations = 0</strong> terminates any audio in process from the originating Working Set (Frequency and Duration values are ignored); 1 – 255 sets the number of audio activations.</p>

<h2>param[in] {u8NumOfRepit, uint8_t}</h2>

<p>Number of repetitions Range: 1 - 255</p>

<h2>param[in] {u16Frequency, uint16_t}</h2>

<p>Frequency</p>

<h2>param[in] {u16OnTimeMs, uint16_t}</h2>

<p>On time duration in ms</p>

<h2>param[in] {u16OffTimeMs, uint16_t}</h2>

<p>Off time duration in ms</p>

<h2>Return Values (s16result):</h2>

<h3>int16_t</h3>

<ul>
	<li><span style="color:#27ae60">VT_E_NO_ERR (0)</span> - OK</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NOT_READY (-131)</span> - VT client not yet ready</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_OVERFLOW (-6)</span> - buffer overflow</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NOACT (-8)</span> - Command not possible in current state</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NO_INSTANCE (-21)</span> - No VT client available</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_ISO_INSTANCE_INVALID (-129)</span> - Identifier for instance (connection) invalid</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_HANDLE_INVALID (-128)</span> - ErrorCause: invalid Handle</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NOT_ALIVE (-130)</span> - Identifier for instance valid, but VT Dead.</li>
	<li><span style="color:#2980b9">VT_OK_BUFFERED (18)</span> - command buffered, waiting for VT to be ready</li>
</ul>
<h2>Instanz-Eindeutigkeit (Instance Uniqueness)</h2>

<p>Dieser Baustein ist konzeptionell als Singleton (genau eine Instanz im gesamten Programm) vorgesehen.</p>
]]></Attribute>
	<Attribute Name="eclipse4diac::core::TypeHash" Value="''"/>
</FBType>
